 during the quarter?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/22/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q4-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"SKY 2019 Q4","e":"sky","d":"2019-05-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Laurie Hough","x":"These improvements are resulting from eliminating redundant material costs, streamlining throughput and refining product mix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/22/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q4-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"SKY 2020 Q1","e":"sky","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Yost","x":"I think the question would be with tariffs coming in or maybe slight input costs increasing, you'll probably be a little delayed in passing through some of those price increases for a month or two.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q1-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"SKY 2020 Q1","e":"sky","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Philip Ng","x":"The tariffs, I understand, are coming through, obviously.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q1-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"SKY 2020 Q1","e":"sky","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Laurie Hough","x":"There is a little bit of price increase year-over-year, just from the timing of our price increases from the raw material inflation last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q1-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"SKY 2020 Q1","e":"sky","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Daniel Moore","x":"Maybe just walk us through how much of an impact was pass through of rising raw material costs year-over-year in terms of pricing and what did the mix look like?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q1-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"SKY 2020 Q1","e":"sky","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Daniel Moore","x":"I'm wondering if you're selling maybe a slightly higher proportion of park models and smaller homes, given the streamlining efforts in California.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q1-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"SKY 2020 Q2","e":"sky","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Colin Devine","x":"…any more color on the value proposition that this has for the builder developers, like how much cost savings you can pass along and how much time do you anticipate being able to save the builder developers and I know it's early days, but any quantification of the opportunity size that you see…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q2-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"SKY 2020 Q3","e":"sky","d":"2020-01-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Rohit Seth","x":"All right, I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q3-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"SKY 2020 Q4","e":"sky","d":"2020-05-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Laurie Hough","x":"Additionally, we implemented compensation savings by closely monitoring over time and through furloughing and layoff of employees.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/21/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"SKY 2020 Q4","e":"sky","d":"2020-05-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Yost","x":"As we manage through the day-to-day challenges brought on by the pandemic, we are continuing to focus and invest in our strategic initiatives of streamlining our products, digital offerings to our customers and adding more value and sustainability to turnkey services and the elimination of waste.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/21/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"SKY 2021 Q2","e":"sky","d":"2020-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Laurie Hough","x":"We have instituted price increases to help offset a portion of the increased material costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"SKY 2021 Q2","e":"sky","d":"2020-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark Yost","x":"But overall, I would say, we're generally able to pass on those price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"SKY 2021 Q3","e":"sky","d":"2021-02-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Laurie Hough","x":"The average selling price per U.S. homes increased by 4% to $63,000 due to price increases in response to rising material costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/02/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"SKY 2021 Q3","e":"sky","d":"2021-02-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Laurie Hough","x":"So it's plant-dependent, but we have been taking some price increases in January.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/02/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"SKY 2021 Q3","e":"sky","d":"2021-02-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Yost","x":"…of fiscal 2021, we were able to increase daily production rates over the levels achieved in the prior year, as well as direct staffing -- labor-staffing levels that have increased and production efficiencies have improved, due in part to the progress made on streamlining product offerings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/02/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"SKY 2021 Q3","e":"sky","d":"2021-02-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Yost","x":"So overall, we've made tremendous progress throughout this fiscal year in streamlining our product offerings to increase the throughput.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/02/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"SKY 2021 Q4","e":"sky","d":"2021-05-26","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Laurie Hough","x":"Another component that's going to go into the EBITDA margin is an increase in SG&A from our digital offerings and investment in our direct-to-consumer platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q4-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"SKY 2021 Q4","e":"sky","d":"2021-05-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Laurie Hough","x":"The average selling price per U.S. home sold increased by 11.6% to $67,200 due to product mix and price increases in response to rising material costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q4-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"SKY 2021 Q4","e":"sky","d":"2021-05-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark Yost","x":"But I think what we're seeing more so is really our price increases vis-a-vis traditional site builders is much lower.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q4-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"SKY 2021 Q4","e":"sky","d":"2021-05-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Yost","x":"Our improved production efficiencies allowed us to increase daily production rates over the levels achieved in the sequential third quarter due in part to the progress made on streamlining product offerings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q4-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"SKY 2021 Q4","e":"sky","d":"2021-05-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Yost","x":"So I think it's really streamlining some of those front-end.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/skyline-champion-corp-sky-q4-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"SKY 2022 Q1","e":"sky","d":"2021-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Laurie Hough","x":"The average selling price per U.S. homes sold increased by 16% to $71,800 due to product mix and price increases in response to rising material costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/skyline-champion-corporation-sky-q1-2022-earnings/"},{"c":"SKY 2022 Q1","e":"sky","d":"2021-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Laurie Hough","x":"…leverage and efficiencies more than offsetting the deterioration in margin from material price increases. [Indecipherable] in the first quarter increased to $54 million from $40.8 million in the same period last year, primarily due to higher variable compensation and travel expenses as…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/skyline-champion-corporation-sky-q1-2022-earnings/"},{"c":"SKY 2022 Q1","e":"sky","d":"2021-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Yost","x":"Our improved production efficiencies allowed us to increase daily production rates over the levels achieved in this sequential fourth quarter, due in part to the progress made on streamlining product offerings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/skyline-champion-corporation-sky-q1-2022-earnings/"},{"c":"SKY 2022 Q1","e":"sky","d":"2021-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Yost","x":"As mentioned on the previous call, with the recently acquired facilities and our product streamlining efforts to date, we are resetting our total capacity levels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/skyline-champion-corporation-sky-q1-2022-earnings/"},{"c":"SKY 2022 Q2","e":"sky","d":"2021-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark Yost","x":"Increased output along with price increases to cover rising material, labor, and freight costs drove revenue to $524 million in the second quarter, up 63% from the prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/skyline-champion-corporation-sky-q2-2022-earnings/"},{"c":"SKY 2022 Q2","e":"sky","d":"2021-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Laurie Hough","x":"The average selling price per U.S. home increased by 32% to $79,900 due to product mix and price increases in response to rising material, labor, and freight costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/skyline-champion-corporation-sky-q2-2022-earnings/"},{"c":"SKY 2022 Q2","e":"sky","d":"2021-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Yost","x":"By streamlining of our product offerings, it really helped to offset the material supply shortages.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/skyline-champion-corporation-sky-q2-2022-earnings/"},{"c":"SKY 2022 Q2","e":"sky","d":"2021-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Laurie Hough","x":"Our U.S. housing segment gross margins were 24.7% of segment net sales, up 550 basis points from the second quarter last year due to improved operating efficiencies and leverage of fixed costs as we continue to see the benefit of streamlining our product offering.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/skyline-champion-corporation-sky-q2-2022-earnings/"},{"c":"SKY 2025 Q2","e":"sky","d":"2024-10-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mark Yost","x":"Our performance this quarter demonstrates effective execution across the company, particularly enhancing our digital direct-to-consumer strategy, advancing the integration of Regional Homes acquisition and scaling the benefits from Champion Financing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/champion-homes-sky-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SKY 2025 Q2","e":"sky","d":"2024-10-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mark Yost","x":"…think we're very active in thinking about that and that would be our top capital priority as we go forward and then innovation in driving some of the growth of our platforms and our direct-to-consumer strategy would also be pivotal in that, along with, of course, since we're generating high cash.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/champion-homes-sky-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SKY 2026 Q1","e":"sky","d":"2025-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Laurie M. Hough","x":"And then as far as tariffs are concerned, we have evaluated the tariff impact.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/25/champion-homes-sky-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SKY 2026 Q1","e":"sky","d":"2025-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Laurie M. Hough","x":"Our current estimate is that our unmitigated impact on our material cost is approximately 1% of our material cost for tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/25/champion-homes-sky-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SKY 2026 Q1","e":"sky","d":"2025-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Glaser Dahl","x":"I think the mix side is pretty clear, but you mentioned price increases on new products and at your captive retail.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/25/champion-homes-sky-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SKY 2026 Q1","e":"sky","d":"2025-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Glaser Dahl","x":"So can you speak a little more to what those like-for-like pricing dynamics were, where you took price, the rationale for taking price and what the response has been?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/25/champion-homes-sky-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SKY 2026 Q2","e":"sky","d":"2025-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Laurie Hough","x":"Gross margin increased sequentially from our first fiscal quarter and was higher than expectations, primarily due to lower-than-expected material input costs, including tariff impacts, higher captive retail ASPs and favorable product mix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/25/champion-sky-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SKY 2026 Q2","e":"sky","d":"2025-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Laurie Hough","x":"As you touched on, certainly lower material input costs than we expected, including the impact of tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/25/champion-sky-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SKY 2026 Q2","e":"sky","d":"2025-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Laurie Hough","x":"The average home selling price in Canada increased 7% to $133,300 due to price increases and a shift in product mix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/25/champion-sky-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SKY 2026 Q2","e":"sky","d":"2025-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Timothy Larson","x":"In our captive retail stores, we've mentioned, we didn't take price for a while.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/25/champion-sky-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SKY 2026 Q3","e":"sky","d":"2026-02-04","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Timothy Larson","x":"It's a key capability that leverages our investments to generate leads for our independent retailers through our direct-to-consumer strategy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/25/champion-homes-sky-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SKY 2026 Q3","e":"sky","d":"2026-02-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David McKinstray","x":"I think, first, the team has done a great job managing our tariff impact and working with our various suppliers to do that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/25/champion-homes-sky-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SKY 2026 Q3","e":"sky","d":"2026-02-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David McKinstray","x":"Now, of course, on tariffs, it's an evolving situation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/25/champion-homes-sky-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SKY 2026 Q4","e":"sky","d":"2026-05-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy Larson","x":"So recall, and we've mentioned this in the past that we took price within our captive retail.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/26/champion-homes-sky-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SKY 2026 Q4","e":"sky","d":"2026-05-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy Larson","x":"From a freight perspective, it is mostly a pass-through, but it's part of the broader cost side of things that we're looking at with each of our partners as we go forward and ultimately, the consumer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/26/champion-homes-sky-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SKY 2026 Q4","e":"sky","d":"2026-05-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Philip Ng","x":"I mean you gave some color, Dave, for 1Q gross margins in that 24% to 25.5% range, appreciating some of the continuous improvement in cost out initiatives you're looking to ramp up hasn't kicked in yet, but is there a path perhaps in the back half where margins get back in that 26%, 27% range?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/26/champion-homes-sky-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SKY 2027 Q2","e":"sky","d":"2026-11-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Timothy Larson","x":"It is also reflected in our channel diversification, retail expansion, product innovation and our direct-to-consumer platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/champion-homes-sky-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SKY 2027 Q2","e":"sky","d":"2026-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David McKinstray","x":"So ASP, largely the price realization that we drove within the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/champion-homes-sky-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[36,1,5108,0,0,0,4157,483],[37,1,6030,0,